GET {{tlsSelfSignedUrl}}/tls

::: post
test("served with the self-signed certificate", () => {
  expect(res.status).toBe(200);
  expect(res.json().profile).toBe("self-signed");
  expect(res.json().tls).toBe(true);
});

::: docs
With the default setting (warn) the request is sent and a certificate warning is shown. With reject it fails.
